fi
text Pff!
text Fuko forcefully slaps my hand away, then stands up and starts running away.
text *BAM*
text She crashes into the wall, then falls down onto the floor.
text @[Tomoya]
text Shit... This is way more than I expected...
text @[Tomoya]
text I shouldn't have tried it on a human!
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU17"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
