text *Cough*
sound 252.aac
text @[Fuko]
text Okazaki-san...
text Fuko raises her upper body up from the ground with her elbows to look at me.
sound 253.aac
text @[Fuko]
text Fuko seems to have eaten something weird...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
text @[Tomoya]
text How was the... taste?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU31"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
